<title>USA: Donnelly registers to sell 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Donnelly registers to sell 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLAND, Mich. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnelly Corp said it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to sell 1.5 million shares of Class A common stock.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to repay indebtedness, including indebtedness incurred under the company's revolving credit agreements, the company said.</p>
<p>Donnelly makes automotive rearview mirrors systems, windows and automotive lighting and trim products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
